  "I can show IAMPARIS data, find a page or a tool, explain a concept, or pick the studies relevant to you."
> where can I compare models side by side?
  navigation [answered (rules)] Model Comparison
  "Open this page on IAMPARIS."
> which models cover SDGs like water or health?
  navigation [answered (rules)] SDG Model Coverage Matrix
  "Open this page on IAMPARIS."

